 have you called the landlord about your basement yet?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, I was going to but I haven't been down there in a while.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Weren't you supposed to look for problems like leakages? Your landlord should maintain it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He was going to have it renovated, but he never got around to doing it.", "id": 1}, {"time": "16000", "image": "engenn9le07ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It could be a mess down there now. Wasn't it leaking?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. He was supposed to send me a contact number for someone to look at it. I'm still waiting for it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should follow up on that. Get some information yourself and pass it on. If he has to spend a lot money on it, he'll probably raise the rent. Besides, it's unhealthy. When was the last time he had any work done?", "id": 2}, {"time": "39500", "image": "engenn9le07ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Not since I moved here. He was going to do some repairs that year. He got an estimate, but didn't have the money. I'll remind him. You're right. It's probably moldy! I'm allergic to mold! The basement needs to be sealed properly and thoroughly cleaned. I can't keep anything down there.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  He needs to install a dehumidifier. You can call the landlord tenant hotline if he does nothing. They can call and remind him of his obligations.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're right. I'll call to him tonight and get him to get someone in here. If he does nothing again, I will call the hotline.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}